  "rationale": "Setting --skip_qiime makes both run_qiime2_taxonomy and run_qiime2 false, so QIIME2 classifier training and classification, the QIIME2 import, filtering, export, barplot, diversity and ANCOM steps no longer run, along with the QIIME2-only helpers (FILTER_SAMPLES, METADATA_*, PHYLOSEQ_INASV, PHYLOSEQ_INTAX_QIIME2). The DADA2 phyloseq/TreeSE objects are rebuilt from the unfiltered ASV table, the raw metadata and no tree. MultiQC (versions and params summary) and the summary report get changed inputs; the DADA2 summary tables and Parquet tasks stay identical, since only the QIIME2 task disappears."
